msgid "Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing."
msgstr "ገጽን ማረም ትርጉሞቹን ጊዜ ያለፈባቸው ያደርጋቸዋል እና ከበስተጀርባ እንደገና ይዘጋጃሉ። ምንም ቃላትን ሳይቀይሩ ማረም ምንም አያስወጣም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:214
msgid "What gets translated"
msgstr "ምን ይተረጎማል"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:219
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "የልጥፍ ዓይነቶች"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:232
